  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "proposing some small changes to TriplestoreConnector for Fedora 3.5 release:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "deprecate init(Map), add setConfiguration(Map) and getConfiguration(Map)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "allow for constructor injection of config map on impls that support it",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "add an open() method, so that configuration might be inspected by client code before use (existing impls can be updated to call open() within their getReader/Writer methods).",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Also, removing log4j dependency in favor of slf4j seems desirable (and relatively easy).  I'm not done with the other patch (json), but I think this stuff is important enough to prioritize it.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
